dt=Text
<node>
$start
2
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
name:The Mystery of Silver Mountain
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
image.b:png/silver_mountain_C64.png
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
onfirst
3
clear
msg:\c##SUBTITLE##
	\c
	\cOriginal \yBASIC\w Game by
	\c\y##ORIGINALAUTHOR##\w
	\c\y##ORIGINALPUBLISHER##\w
	\c
	\c\yStoryTllrC64\w release 
	\cby \y##AUTHOR##\w
waitkey
clear
msg:This is a two-disk game. Please insert the second disk now. 
msg:When, changing location, you won't see its image, swap disk and write 'image' to reload (it won't happen too often, but it will happen)
waitkey
clear
goto:_introduction

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
_introduction
2
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
name:Introduction
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
image.b:png/silver_mountain_C64.png
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
onfirst
3
clear
msg:The Sylvani once lived peacefully at the foot of Silver Mountain, guided by wise Elders and protected by the mystical Stone of Destiny. 
msg: But when the vicious Grarg army invaded, their queen, Pari Sylvan, used the Stone to resist them. 
msg: In the battle of minds that followed, a traitor fell, and the Grarg wizard Magrarg seized control. The Sylvani became slaves under the brutal Overlord Ogban. 
msg: Queen Pari's son, Kylar, raised in secret, sought magical relics to defeat the evil, but was killed before completing his quest. 
msg: Now the Elders call to any brave soul: will you finish what Kylar began?
setvar:maxweight,13
setvar:coinnum,4
setvar:bootsusage,0
setvar:boatwater,0
setvar:magicwords,0
waitkey
goto:crossroads

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
_dead
2
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
name:You're dead!
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
image.b:png/silver_mountain_C64.png
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
onfirst
3
clear
msg:You have failed in your quest!
msg:Your sudden death is yet another failure in the attempt to free the Sylvani people from tyranny.
msg:Do you want to try again? (Y/N)
getkey
ifkey:Y
	start
else
	quit

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
_end
2
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
name:Your land is free again!
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
image.b:png/silver_mountain_C64.png
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
onfirst
3
clear
msg:Hooorrrraaayyyy!
msg:Congratulation, you have succeeded in your quest and your efforts have finally made it possible to restore peace to the land of the Sylvani.
msg:Your name will be remembered forever.
waitkey
quit

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
